.TH MU2EDAQ\-DOWNTIME\-LOGGER.YAML 5 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-downtime-logger 0.1.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger.yaml \- downtime logger configuration file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I config/config.example.yaml
.br
.I config/local.yaml
.br
any file given to
.B mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger \-\-config
.SH DESCRIPTION
One YAML document with four top\-level mappings:
.BR storage ,
.BR metric ,
.B detectors
and the optional
.BR webserver .
It is read once at startup by
.B yaml.safe_load
(src/downtime_logger/config.py); there is no reload.
.PP
.B storage
and
.B metric
are mandatory (a missing one aborts with
.IR "Missing required config section" ),
at least one detector is required, and detector
.B id
values must be unique.
Unknown top\-level keys are ignored.
.PP
There is no search path, no environment\-variable layer and no
.I .env
file: the
.B \-\-config
option is required and names the only file read.
.PP
Every
.B plugin
value is
.IR module.path:ClassName ,
imported with
.B importlib
and instantiated with the
.B options
mapping as keyword arguments.
A module anywhere on
.B PYTHONPATH
can be named; see
.BR downtime_logger (3).
.SH STORAGE
.TP
.B plugin
Shipped:
.BR downtime_logger.storage.sqlite_backend:SQLiteBackend .
.TP
.B options.path
SQLite file.
Default
.BR events.db .
Tilde\-expanded and resolved against the process working directory; parent
directories are created.
.TP
.B options.echo
Boolean; log every SQL statement.
Default
.BR false .
.SH WEBSERVER
Optional read\-only HTTP view, documented in
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger\-api (7).
.TP
.B enabled
Default
.BR false .
When false neither the HTTP server nor the
.B mu2edaq\-discovery
announcement starts.
.TP
.B bind
Default
.BR 0.0.0.0 .
.TP
.B port
Default
.BR 8088 .
.I config/local.yaml
uses 127.0.0.1:8001.
The control\-room application inventory
.RB ( mu2edaq\-controlroom\-setup ,
.IR config/apps.yaml )
assigns 8088, but the application does not read the
.B CRS_PORT_HTTP
variable it exports; only this key sets the port.
A bind failure aborts startup.
.TP
.B refresh_seconds
HTML meta\-refresh interval of the status page.
Default
.BR 5 .
.TP
.B history_limit
Events listed on
.B /
and returned by
.BR /api/events .
Default
.BR 200 .
.SH METRIC
.TP
.B plugin
Shipped:
.BR downtime_logger.core.metric:WeightedRatioMetric .
.TP
.B options.trip_threshold
While no event is open, an event is requested when
.RI score " >= " trip_threshold .
Default
.BR 0.6 .
.TP
.B options.clear_threshold
While an event is open, it is held while
.RI score " > " clear_threshold
and released otherwise.
Default
.BR 0.2 .
A detector that is stuck DOWN contributes
.IR w_i / sum(w_known)
on its own.
If that exceeds
.I clear_threshold
no event can ever close by itself.
With all detectors reporting this means
.I clear_threshold
must be below
.IR min(w)/sum(w) ;
the example weights give 0.136, so the shipped 0.2 is too high for the
0.5 and 0.6 detectors.
.TP
.B options.debounce_seconds
A requested open or close is applied only if the metric still requests it
after this many seconds.
Removed from the options before the metric is constructed and given to the
state machine.
Default
.BR 5 .
Recorded start and end times are those of the debounce expiry, not of the
first threshold crossing.
.SH DETECTORS
A list of mappings:
.TP
.B id
Unique name; shown in the UI and stored in
.BR detector_state_log .
.TP
.B plugin
Detector class.
.TP
.B weight
Float, default
.BR 1.0 .
A sibling of
.BR options ,
consumed by the state machine; it never reaches the detector.
.TP
.B options
Keyword arguments for the detector.
Every shipped detector swallows unknown keys, so a misspelt option is
silently ignored and its default used.
.SS downtime_logger.detectors.zeromq_detector:ZmqDetector
.TP
.B endpoint
Required.
Endpoint to
.B connect
a
.B ZMQ_SUB
socket to.
The peer must
.B bind
a
.B ZMQ_PUB
socket.
A
.B ZMQ_PULL
peer such as the
.B mu2edaq\-dashboard
bus on 5555 rejects the pairing during the handshake and nothing is ever
received; an unresolvable host is not an error either.
Both cases end as DOWN with detail
.I no zmq messages within timeout
after
.BR heartbeat_timeout_s .
.TP
.B topic
Subscription prefix.
Default empty (all messages).
.TP
.B heartbeat_timeout_s
Default
.BR 10 .
.SS downtime_logger.detectors.udp_detector:UdpDetector
.TP
.B bind
Local address to bind.
Default
.BR 0.0.0.0 .
.TP
.B port
Local UDP port.
Default
.BR 9000 .
A bind failure leaves the detector UNKNOWN.
.TP
.B heartbeat_timeout_s
Default
.BR 15 .
.SS downtime_logger.detectors.soap_detector:SoapDetector
.TP
.B wsdl
Required.
WSDL URL, fetched with
.B zeep
on the first poll and again after any failed call.
.TP
.B operation
Default
.BR getRunState .
.TP
.B args
Mapping passed as keyword arguments to the operation.
Default empty.
.TP
.B state_path
Dotted path into the response.
Default
.BR runState .
.TP
.BR down_values ", " up_values
Lists compared case\-insensitively and exactly with the extracted value.
Defaults
.B [stopped, idle, halted]
and
.BR "[running, active]" .
Anything else, a WSDL failure or a call failure gives UNKNOWN.
.TP
.B poll_s
Default
.BR 5 .
.SS downtime_logger.detectors.disk_detector:DiskActivityDetector
.TP
.B paths
Required list of directories.
A missing directory is skipped with a warning; if none exists the detector
reports DOWN on its first poll.
.TP
.B idle_seconds
DOWN when no file under
.B paths
was modified for this long.
Default
.BR 60 .
.TP
.B poll_s
Default
.BR 5 .
.TP
.B recursive
Default
.BR true .
.SS downtime_logger.detectors.logfile_detector:LogfileDetector
.TP
.BR path ", " paths
One file, a list of files, or both; at least one is required.
A file that does not exist leaves the detector UNKNOWN.
.TP
.BR down_patterns ", " up_patterns
Python regular expressions applied with
.B re.search
to each new line; down patterns first, first match wins.
A missing list means no pattern of that kind.
An invalid expression aborts startup.
YAML double\-quoted strings need doubled backslashes:
.BR "\(dq\e\ebABORT\e\eb\(dq" .
.TP
.B poll_s
Default
.BR 1 .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I config/config.example.yaml
Five\-detector example.
.B zmq_run_status
and
.B artdaq_soap
point at
.IR daq01 ,
a host that does not resolve, on the ports where the package's own
.BR zmq_publish.py (1)
and
.BR soap_server.py (1)
listen by default.
Port 5555 there is also the
.B mu2edaq\-dashboard
PULL port, which this detector cannot read.
Replace both endpoints before use.
.TP
.I config/local.yaml
Workstation test file: UDP on 127.0.0.1:9000,
.IR /tmp/daq\-test ,
.IR /tmp/daq\-test/run.log ,
web view on 127.0.0.1:8001, thresholds 0.5/0.2, debounce 2 s.
Default of
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger.sh (1).
.SH EXAMPLES
Single UDP heartbeat detector:
.PP
.RS
.nf
storage:
  plugin: downtime_logger.storage.sqlite_backend:SQLiteBackend
  options: {path: ./events.db}
metric:
  plugin: downtime_logger.core.metric:WeightedRatioMetric
  options: {trip_threshold: 0.6, clear_threshold: 0.1, debounce_seconds: 5}
detectors:
  \- id: udp_heartbeat
    plugin: downtime_logger.detectors.udp_detector:UdpDetector
    options: {bind: 0.0.0.0, port: 9000, heartbeat_timeout_s: 15}
webserver: {enabled: true, bind: 0.0.0.0, port: 8088}
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger (1),
.BR mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger\-api (7),
.BR downtime_logger (3),
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-downtime\-logger.sh (1)
